Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)
```turtle
@prefix : <http://cecs571.csulb.edu/ontology/cornercase#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

:scene1 a :Scene ;
    :scenarioName "NighttimeUrbanParkingLotScene" ;
    :hasCornerCaseType :cc1 .

:cc1 a :StateAnomaly ;
    :hasActor :vehicle1 ;
    :hasObstacle :roadObject1 ;
    :hasWeatherCondition :weather1 ;
    :hasRisk :risk1, :risk2, :risk3 .

:vehicle1 a :Vehicle ;
    :description "Red car in motion" .

:roadObject1 a :RoadObject ;
    :description "Black rectangular object on road, possibly a fallen or misplaced parking lot marker" .

:weather1 a :NightCondition .

:risk1 a :OcclusionRisk ;
    :description "Potential occlusion due to the black rectangular object on the road" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev1 .

:risk2 a :RoadConditionRisk ;
    :description "Road condition risk due to the presence of an unexpected object on the road" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev2 .

:risk3 a :CollisionRisk ;
    :description "Potential collision risk with the object if the vehicle continues on its current path" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev3 .

:sev1 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.7"^^xsd:float .

:sev2 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.6"^^xsd:float .

:sev3 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.8"^^xsd:float .
```

Identified Risks for each risk class:

**Risk 1:**
Description: Potential occlusion due to the black rectangular object on the road.
Severity Score: 0.7

**Risk 2:**
Description: Road condition risk due to the presence of an unexpected object on the road.
Severity Score: 0.6

**Risk 3:**
Description: Potential collision risk with the object if the vehicle continues on its current path.
Severity Score: 0.8